Changes made for My English include selecting and translating hotel vocabulary,
adding pronunciation guidance, authoring a new six-step check-in dialogue, and
adding exercises and review scheduling. No third-party images from the source
packet are reused. This adaptation does not imply endorsement by Ohio
University, OPEN, the U.S. Department of State, or FHI 360.

The Spanish practice assignments in examples/mi-espanol/homework.json are
original exercises written for this project or independently rewritten
adaptations. The worksheet PDF shipped in examples/mi-espanol/materials/
(practica-ser-estar-vocabulario.pdf) is generated by this project's own
tooling. The "ejercicios-vocabulario-a1-1", "ser-estar-practice-a1-01", and
"ser-estar-present-a1-02" assignments were adapted from private classroom
worksheets; the worksheets themselves are not distributed with this
repository, teacher and student names are pseudonymized, and only independently
rewritten exercises and glosses remain.

